0%\">We recognized revenue of $974 million and $729 million in fiscal years 2026 and 2025, respectively, that were included in the prior year end deferred revenue balance.</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:9pt;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#000000;font-family:'NVIDIA Sans',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%\">As of January 25, 2026, revenue related to remaining performance obligations from contracts greater than one year in length was $2.3 billion, which includes $1.9 billion from deferred revenue and $390 million which has not yet been billed nor recognized as revenue. Approximately 42% of revenue from contracts greater than one year in length will be recognized over the next twelve months.</span></div>"
